{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-models","title":"因子模型与量化选股","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 因子模型与量化选股\n\n因子模型是现代量化投资的理论基石，从 Sharpe（1964）的 CAPM 到 Fama-French 五因子模型，再到当前机器学习驱动的高维因子体系，因子投资经历了半个多世纪的学术演进与产业实践。截至 2026 年，全球因子投资（Smart Beta + 量化多因子）管理资产规模已超过 3 万亿美元，因子思维已成为资产管理行业的通用语言。\n\n本 Hub 系统梳理因子模型的完整知识体系：从经典资产定价理论出发，覆盖因子构建、因子检验、组合优化到 Alpha 研究的全流程。内容兼顾学术严谨性与工程实操性，每个主题都包含数学推导、Python 实现示例以及业界最佳实践。\n\n**知识地图：**\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[因子理论基础] --> B[因子构建]\n    B --> C[组合构建]\n    C --> D[Alpha 研究]\n    A --> |CAPM/APT| B\n    B --> |信号检验| C\n    C --> |优化求解| D\n    D --> |反馈| A\n```\n\n**四大章节概览：**\n\n| 章节         | 核心问题                   | 关键方法                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| 因子理论基础 | 为什么因子能解释收益？     | CAPM、APT、Fama-French      |\n| 因子构建     | 如何定义和验证一个好因子？ | 截面回归、IC 分析、衰减建模 |\n| 组合构建     | 如何将因子信号转化为持仓？ | MVO、风险平价、约束优化     |\n| Alpha 研究   | 如何发现新的超额收益来源？ | 信号挖掘、另类数据、ML 模型 |\n\n本 Hub 面向具备基础金融学和统计学知识的读者，适合量化研究员、投资组合经理以及对系统化投资感兴趣的技术从业者。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"factor-theory","title":"因子理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capm-apt","title":"CAPM 与套利定价理论","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/capm-apt"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fama-french-models","title":"Fama-French 多因子模型演进","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/fama-french-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-zoo","title":"因子动物园与复制危机","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/factor-zoo"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"factor-construction","title":"因子构建","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"factor-definition","title":"因子定义与计算方法","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-definition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"factor-testing","title":"因子检验与统计方法","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-decay","title":"因子衰减与半衰期分析","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-decay"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio-construction","title":"组合构建","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mean-variance-optimization","title":"均值方差优化与改进","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/mean-variance-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-parity","title":"风险平价与层次风险平价","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/risk-parity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio-constraints","title":"组合约束与交易成本","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/portfolio-construction/portfolio-constraints"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"alpha-research","title":"Alpha 研究","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"alpha-signal-mining","title":"Alpha 信号挖掘方法","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/alpha-signal-mining"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alternative-data","title":"另类数据与非传统因子","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/alternative-data"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ml-factor-models","title":"机器学习因子模型","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/ml-factor-models"}]}]}